          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```python\nfrom math import *\n\nclass Diem:\n    x = 0\n    y = 0\n\n    def dat_vi_tri(self, x, y):\n        self.x = x\n        self.y = y\n\n    def khoang_cach_tu_tam_o(self):\n        return sqrt(self.x * self.x + self.y * self.y)\n\n    def khoang_cach(self, other):\n        dx = self.x - other.x\n        dy = self.y - other.y\n        return sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy)\n```",
