          "content": "Operator Overloading"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.038,
            0.201,
            0.933,
            0.305
          ],
          "content": "**operator overloading**: You can define functions so that Python's built-in operators can be used with your class."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.139,
            0.314,
            0.854,
            0.357
          ],
          "content": "• See also: [http://docs.python.org/ref/customization.html](http://docs.python.org/ref/customization.html)"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.03,
            0.397,
            0.493,
            0.658
          ],
          "content": "| Operator | Class Method |\n| --- | --- |\n| - | __sub__(self, other) |\n| + | __add__(self, other) |\n| * | __mul__(self, other) |\n| / | __truediv__(self, other) |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_11_table_3.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.66,
            0.36,
            0.696
          ],
          "content": "Unary Operators"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.03,
            0.695,
            0.492,
            0.803
          ],
          "content": "| - | __neg__(self) |\n| --- | --- |\n| + | __pos__(self) |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_11_table_5.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.514,
            0.398,
            0.976,
            0.763
          ],
          "content": "| Operator | Class Method |\n| --- | --- |\n| == | __eq__(self, other) |\n| != | __ne__(self, other) |\n| &lt; | __lt__(self, other) |\n| > | __gt__(self, other) |\n| &lt;= | __le__(self, other) |\n| >= | __ge__(self, other) |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_11_table_6.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.0,
            0.89,
            0.567,
            0.983
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "2 python\" HIENLTH"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.96,
            0.955,
            0.986,
            0.979
          ],
          "content": "12"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 12,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.394,
            0.042,
            0.609,
            0.137
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Bài tập"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.038,
            0.194,
            0.949,
            0.323
          ],
          "content": "• **Viết class PhanSo** để biểu diễn phân số như 1/2 hay -3/8."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.038,
            0.371,
            0.873,
            0.496
          ],
          "content": "• Viết hàm rút gọn phân số; ví dụ, rút gọn 4/12 thành 1/3 hay 6/-9 thành -2/3."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.506,
            0.907,
            0.617
          ],
          "content": "– Hint: Sử dụng hàm tìm ước chứng lớn nhất (greatest common divisor) ➔ math.gcd(a,b)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.037,
            0.697,
            0.804,
            0.761
          ],
          "content": "• Định nghĩa hàm **cong** và **nhan** 2 phân số"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.037,
            0.81,
            0.677,
            0.873
          ],
          "content": "• Định nghĩa các toán tử +, \\*, ==, <"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.0,
            0.892,
            0.063,
            0.979
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_12_image_6.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.0,
            0.891,
            0.568,
            0.985
          ],
          "content": "2 python HIENLTH"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.961,
            0.955,
            0.986,
            0.98
          ],
          "content": "13"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 13,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.047,
            0.851,
            0.133
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Generating Exceptions"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.077,
            0.191,
            0.667,
            0.241
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "raise ExceptionType(\"message\")"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.296,
            0.811,
            0.344
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "– useful when the client uses your object improperly"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.087,
            0.353,
            0.915,
            0.437
          ],
          "content": "– types: ArithmeticError, AssertionError, IndexError, NameError, SyntaxError, TypeError, ValueError"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.087,
            0.488,
            0.252,
            0.535
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "– Example:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.559,
            0.44,
            0.596
          ],
          "content": "class BankAccount:"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "bbox": [
            0.19,
            0.643,
            0.95,
            0.788
          ],
          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```python\ndef deposit(self, amount):\n    if amount < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"negative amount\")\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": []
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.0,
            0.89,
            0.567,
            0.983
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "2 python HIENLTH"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.961,
            0.955,
            0.985,
            0.979
          ],
          "content": "14"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 14,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.043,
            0.832,
            0.134
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Inheritance (thừa kế)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.077,
            0.191,
            0.528,
            0.29
          ],
          "content": "class **name**(**superclass**): **statements**"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "bbox": [
            0.083,
            0.341,
            0.884,
            0.533
          ],
          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```python\n- Ví dụ:\n  class Diem3D(Diem):    # Diem3D extends Diem\n    z = 0\n    ...\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": []
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.038,
            0.627,
            0.814,
            0.8
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "• Python also supports multiple inheritance class name(superclass, ..., superclass): statements"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.854,
            0.893,
            0.889
          ],
          "content": "(if > 1 superclass has the same field/method, conflicts are resolved in left right order)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.0,
            0.892,
            0.567,
            0.984
          ],
          "content": "2 python HIENLTH"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.961,
            0.955,
            0.986,
            0.979
          ],
          "content": "15"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 15,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.077,
            0.045,
            0.924,
            0.133
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Calling Superclass Methods"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.036,
            0.187,
            0.947,
            0.241
          ],
          "content": "• methods: **class**.**method**(**object**, **parameters**)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.036,
            0.259,
            0.835,
            0.315
          ],
          "content": "• constructors: **class**.\\_\\_init\\_\\_(**parameters**)"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.358,
            0.841,
            0.643
          ],
          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```python\nclass Diem3D(Diem):\n    z = 0\n    def __init__(self, x, y, z):\n        Diem.__init__(self, x, y)\n        self.z = z\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": []
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.704,
            0.948,
            0.871
          ],
          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```python\ndef dich_chuyen(self, dx, dy, dz):\n    Diem.dich_chuyen(self, dx, dy)\n    self.z += dz\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": []
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.0,
            0.889,
            0.568,
            0.985
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "2 python\" HIENLTH"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.96,
            0.955,
            0.986,
            0.98
          ],
          "content": "16"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 16,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.281,
            0.047,
            0.715,
            0.125
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Static method"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.038,
            0.196,
            0.966,
            0.322
          ],
          "content": "• Để định nghĩa method dạng static thì thêm từ khóa **@staticmethod**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.039,
            0.338,
            0.184,
            0.398
          ],
          "content": "• Ví dụ:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.037,
            0.415,
            0.383,
            0.472
          ],
          "content": "class **class\\_name**:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.142,
            0.489,
            0.413,
            0.545
          ],
          "content": "@staticmethod"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.138,
            0.563,
            0.849,
            0.625
          ],
          "content": "def **static\\_method\\_name**(param\\_list):"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.239,
            0.647,
            0.326,
            0.697
          ],
          "content": "pass"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.039,
            0.711,
            0.244,
            0.773
          ],
          "content": "• Cách gọi:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.787,
            0.782,
            0.849
          ],
          "content": "**class\\_name**.**static\\_method\\_name**()"
        },
